VALUES ('martyrology-api', 'Roman Martyrology API', 'The eulogies of the Roman Martyrology for any liturgical day.', 'Serves the elogia of the Martyrologium Romanum — the short notices read for the saints and blesseds commemorated on each day — keyed to the canonical identifiers in CRMEDR. Built as a companion to the Liturgical Calendar API, so the two answer ''what is celebrated today'' and ''what does the Martyrology say about it'' with the same identifiers. The copyrighted edition texts stay in a private repository; what is public is the API and the identifier scheme.', 'https://github.com/CatholicOS/martyrology-api', NULL, 'https://github.com/CatholicOS/martyrology-api', 'api', 'api', NULL, '[]', 'free', 'Open source; self-hosted or run from the repository.', 1, 'Apache-2.0', 'unknown', 'unknown', 1, '["Saints","Liturgical Calendar"]', '["la","en"]', 'published', 0, NULL, 'Catholic Digital Commons Foundation', 'https://github.com/CatholicOS')
